#: floppy.cpp:359
msgid ""
"Formatting will erase all data on the disk.\n"
"Are you sure you wish to proceed?"
msgstr ""
"Formateern mokt al di Tüg op de Diskette platt.\n"
"Wüllst du wieder maken?"

#: floppy.cpp:360
msgid "Proceed?"
msgstr "wieder?"

